WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:02.200
Let's go over the problem again.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:05.270
We want to build an application with a list of cats, and when you

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:10.800
click on the cat in the list, they will display in the cat viewing area here.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.550
And what's more, the number for

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:16.890
the number of clicks should always reflect the number of the current cat.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.320
We're going to go through this right now and

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.770
figure out what should belong to the model, the view or views, and the octopus.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.750
First, let's identify the model and the view portions.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.170
Of the following things, choose whether they belong in the model or the view.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:35.060
The clickable list of cats here, the current cat display, and

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.130
the array of cat objects which is driving all of this.

